    "editor": "VNCREmbassyPappasLog2",
    "en": "Jake Erwin Report"
  },
  {
    "row": 283,
    "type": "NOTE:TNAM",
    "editor": "VNCREmbassyPappasLog2",
    "en": "Private Erwin has been causing trouble again. His pranks are starting to go a little too far. One more complaint and I'll put him behind bars."
  },
  {
    "row": 284,
    "type": "NOTE:FULL",
    "editor": "VNCREmbassyPappasLog1",
    "en": "Strip Security Report"
  },
  {
    "row": 285,
    "type": "NOTE:TNAM",
    "editor": "VNCREmbassyPappasLog1",
    "en": "I've notice and increase in the amount of smuggling of restricted items into the Strip. I'm increasing security at the checkpoints to prevent more of this. A report has been sent to Ambassador Crocker via Liza to address this."
  },
  {
    "row": 286,
